for the axppci33 here are the jumper settings for cpu speed:

Frequency	Pin 1-2	Pin 3-4	Pin 5-6
---------	-------	-------	-------
66		out		out		out
100		out		out		in
133		out		in		out
166		out		in		in
200		in		out		out
233		in		out		in
266		in		in		out
300		in		in		in

